{"verse_key": "13:16", "surah": 13, "verse": 16, "text_uthmani": "قُلْ مَن رَّبُّ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ قُلِ ٱللَّهُ ۚ قُلْ أَفَٱتَّخَذْتُم مِّن دُونِهِۦٓ أَوْلِيَآءَ لَا يَمْلِكُونَ لِأَنفُسِهِمْ نَفْعًا وَلَا ضَرًّا ۚ قُلْ هَلْ يَسْتَوِى ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ وَٱلْبَصِيرُ أَمْ هَلْ تَسْتَوِى ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتُ وَٱلنُّورُ ۗ أَمْ جَعَلُوا۟ لِلَّهِ شُرَكَآءَ خَلَقُوا۟ كَخَلْقِهِۦ فَتَشَـٰبَهَ ٱلْخَلْقُ عَلَيْهِمْ ۚ قُلِ ٱللَّهُ خَـٰلِقُ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ وَهُوَ ٱلْوَٰحِدُ ٱلْقَهَّـٰرُ", "translation": "Say, \"Who is Lord of the heavens and earth?\" Say, \"Allāh.\" Say, \"Have you then taken besides Him allies not possessing [even] for themselves any benefit or any harm?\" Say, \"Is the blind equivalent to the seeing? Or is darkness equivalent to light? Or have they attributed to Allāh partners who created like His creation so that the creation [of each] seemed similar to them?\"<sup foot_note=196553>1</sup> Say, \"Allāh is the Creator of all things, and He is the One, the Prevailing.\"<sup foot_note=196552>2</sup>", "verse_from_ms": 381580, "verse_to_ms": 432180, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 381580, "end_ms": 382120}, {"i": 1, "text": "مَن", "start_ms": 382120, "end_ms": 382290}, {"i": 2, "text": "رَّبُّ", "start_ms": 382290, "end_ms": 383070}, {"i": 3, "text": "ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ", "start_ms": 383070, "end_ms": 384570}, {"i": 4, "text": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ", "start_ms": 384570, "end_ms": 385510}, {"i": 5, "text": "قُلِ", "start_ms": 385510, "end_ms": 386000}, {"i": 6, "text": "ٱللَّهُ", "start_ms": 386000, "end_ms": 388540}, {"i": 7, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 388540, "end_ms": 388910}, {"i": 8, "text": "قُلْ", "start_ms": 388910, "end_ms": 390700}, {"i": 9, "text": "أَفَٱتَّخَذْتُم", "start_ms": 390700, "end_ms": 391610}, {"i": 10, "text": "مِّن", "start_ms": 391610, "end_ms": 394030}, {"i": 11, "text": "دُونِهِۦٓ", "start_ms": 394030, "end_ms": 396920}, {"i": 12, "text": "أَوْلِيَآءَ", 